  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2025, the Thailand team, upon an unanticipated request by the Department of Climate Change &amp; Environment, spent approximately 2-3 months drafting the&#xa0;Thailand NDC Investment Plan which was subsequently approved by the Cabinet.All work was conducted in-house and no core or earmarked expenses were incurred as a result of delivering the NDC Investment Plan.This is a request to create the corresponding project code for reporting purposes in EOYR. The Strategy Unit does not recognize any achievements that does not have a corresponding output in GGGIOnline.</narrative>
  </description>
